      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "None of this is hard C++.\nAll of it is unfamiliar C++.\n\nThose two feel the same from\noutside, and they are fixed by\ncompletely different things.\n\nMore C++ does not help.\nThis sheet does.",
      "originalText": "None of this is hard C++.\nAll of it is unfamiliar C++.\n\nThose two feel the same from\noutside, and they are fixed by\ncompletely different things.\n\nMore C++ does not help.\nThis sheet does.",
