      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The three people get wrong first:\n\n  as_a is not the safe one\n  GTY does nothing at run time\n  == on a poly_int may not compile",
      "originalText": "The three people get wrong first:\n\n  as_a is not the safe one\n  GTY does nothing at run time\n  == on a poly_int may not compile",
